          "level": "none",
          "notes": "ASE's .traj writer persists no custom per-atom array \u2014 not under a format-scoped name, not under a plain one \u2014 so a carry-through column cannot be written at all. Per-frame metadata (atoms.info) is unaffected."
        },
        "user_metadata.custom_per_frame": {
          "level": "full",
          "notes": "Written back as atoms.info key-values."
